<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>% get the noise density&#x000D;&#x000A;SNR =30;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;Bandwidth_Hz = BaseSampleRate;&#x000D;&#x000A;SignalPower_dBm = 10 * log10(SignalPower*1000);&#x000D;&#x000A;NDensity_dBm = SignalPower_dBm - SNR - 10*log10(Bandwidth_Hz);&#x000D;&#x000A;NDensity = 10^(NDensity_dBm/10)/1000;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
